{"unit_id":"kianajunjie__hippocampus_22#card-zh","repo":"kianajunjie/hippocampus_22","commit":"ced876e7c926717520b5732c6c35ec024556fb6d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"hippocampus-22 是一个为 DSH 网页或终端会话加入陪伴型情感记忆的插件。它把本地 SQLite 记忆核心接入系统提示词，并提供记忆召回和主动记录工具，也会定时整理记忆。核心可编码重要事件、按情绪衰减和合并记忆、按线索召回并标注记忆确定度，还支持关系、事实、章节、技能与未知事项等记忆层。适合希望机器人延续长期对话背景的 DSH 用户。使用 Node.js 内置 SQLite；事件编码等 LLM 功能可选配置 DeepSeek API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapters/dsh.mjs:20-25","src/adapters/dsh.mjs:55-83","src/index.mjs:65-78","src/replay.mjs:5-52"]}
{"unit_id":"kianajunjie__hippocampus_22#card-en","repo":"kianajunjie/hippocampus_22","commit":"ced876e7c926717520b5732c6c35ec024556fb6d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"hippocampus-22 adds emotional memory to DSH. It inserts local SQLite memories into prompts and offers tools to recall or record them. The core encodes events, applies emotion-weighted decay, recalls with confidence labels, and tracks facts and relationships. LLM encoding can use a DeepSeek API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapters/dsh.mjs:20-25","src/adapters/dsh.mjs:55-83","src/index.mjs:65-78","src/replay.mjs:5-52"]}
